# Terraform/Packer state and inputs live on cloud-ops only: the state holds resource IDs,
# the home IP and host keys. .terraform.lock.hcl (provider checksums) IS committed once generated.
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/*.tfvars
!terraform/terraform.tfvars.example
terraform/*.auto.tfvars
terraform/crash.log
terraform/*.tfplan
packer/manifest.json
packer/packer_cache/
